WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.033
-New bombshell text messages

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.100
from the latest filing

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.000
in the Dominion lawsuit
against Fox News

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.634
have revealed what Fox hosts,
like Tucker Carlson,

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:10.100
were really saying
about Donald Trump

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.534
and his presidency in private

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:14.067
even though in public,
Tucker and his GOP allies

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:15.501
were still trying
to rewrite the history

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:16.834
of what happened
on January 6th.

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:18.868
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:23.133
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:25.434
Fox News has a very unique

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.234
and very weird relationship
with its audience.

00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:28.601
You see, Fox does something

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:30.567
that virtually no other
mainstream media outlet does.

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:31.834
They tell their viewers

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:35.300
that they can only trust
Fox News, and no one else.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.067
They're like a creepy husband
from a Lifetime movie.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.601
[ Laughter ]
"Don't you see, Janet?

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.133
Your friends are lying
to you, Janet.

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.701
I'm the only one you can trust!"

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:45.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.634
Say whatever else you want
about the mainstream media,

00:00:47.634 --> 00:00:49.567
and there's plenty to say
about how corporate media

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:52.167
limits the scope of acceptable
debate in American politics

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:53.634
on issues
like income inequality

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:54.868
or military spending
or healthcare,

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.400
but generally speaking,

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.901
they don't treat their audience
like captive cult members.

00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:01.300
Like you can think
whatever you want about MSNBC,

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.901
but last I checked,
Steve Kornacki wasn't standing

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:06.567
[ Laughter ]
at his big election board,
saying, "The rest of the media

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.400
will tell you
that Wisconsin is here,

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.234
but I'm the only one
who will tell you

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:13.067
that, actually,
Wisconsin is here."

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:15.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:17.767
One of the biggest proponents
of that message

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:19.400
is Fox host Tucker Carlson,

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.934
who's been telling
his audience, for years,

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:23.734
that the rest of the media
is knowingly lying to them,

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:26.634
specifically,
because they hate Donald Trump.

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:30.367
-Reporters hate Trump
with an all-consuming mania.

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.434
They hate him so intensely
that, at times,

00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:33.901
it's been amusing to watch.

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:35.634
They've succumbed
to Trump hatred

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:38.501
that is so intense,
it has destroyed their judgment

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:40.734
and, in some cases,
affected their character.

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:43.734
The people who run things
hate Trump obsessively.

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:45.334
They always have.
You know that.

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:46.501
They're not hiding it.

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:49.267
Progressives despise
Donald Trump so much,

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:52.367
they've begun to dislike
the country that elected him.

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:53.834
Hate has clouded their vision

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:56.000
and distorted their values,
completely.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.801
One of the reasons progressives
say they hate Donald Trump is

00:01:58.801 --> 00:02:00.767
because he lies a lot.

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:02.634
What infuriates
official Washington

00:02:02.634 --> 00:02:04.434
is not when Trump lies.

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:06.100
It's when he tells the truth.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.133
[ Laughter ]
One of the great
unsolved mysteries

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:11.033
of the past four years is
why certain types of people,

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:15.400
with certain types of jobs,
hate Donald Trump so much,

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.734
really hate him,
obsess over him,

00:02:17.734 --> 00:02:19.434
think about him when they
wake up in the morning,

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:21.133
would hurt him, if they could.

00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:23.267
[ Laughter ]
Why the fixation?

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:27.567
The reason the ruling class
despises Donald Trump is

00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:29.200
because they can't control him.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.133
-They hate him because they
can't control him.

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:32.467
[ Laughter ]
He's talking about Donald Trump

00:02:32.467 --> 00:02:34.934
the way everyone else talks
about the Cocaine Bear.

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:36.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:39.300
[ As Carlson ]
Why the fixation?
Why do they hate him so much?

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.033
Is it because he forsakes
all the liberal pieties

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:43.534
and says things
you're not allowed to say?

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:45.501
Is it because he's a brave
truth teller

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:47.167
and scourge of the establishment

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.667
who refuses to play along
with the woke media regime?

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:52.167
Or is it because he's
an apex predator

00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:54.601
[ Laughter ]
who accidentally inhaled
several kilos

00:02:54.601 --> 00:02:57.234
of highly illicit
Colombian powder
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.234 --> 00:02:59.300
that fell from an airplane
in the skies above Tennessee

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.467
and is now rampaging
across the country,

00:03:01.467 --> 00:03:03.234
out of his [bleep] mind...

00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:04.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:06.300
...savagely murdering hikers
and drug dealers

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.133
while being chased relentlessly
by Keri Russell?

00:03:08.133 --> 00:03:09.367
And, if that's the case...

00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:10.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.701 --> 00:03:12.968
...why do you hate
the Cocaine Bear so much, Keri?

00:03:12.968 --> 00:03:14.834
Is it because the bear
speaks truth to power?

00:03:14.834 --> 00:03:16.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.801 --> 00:03:18.567
Is it because he stands up
for the working class

00:03:18.567 --> 00:03:20.067
against the ruling elite
or is it because he

00:03:20.067 --> 00:03:23.567
viciously disemboweled several
bystanders and drug kingpins

00:03:23.567 --> 00:03:26.934
while loudly sniffing
at public appearances

00:03:26.934 --> 00:03:28.834
because of how
much cocaine he's done?

00:03:28.834 --> 00:03:32.701
-[ Sniffing ]

00:03:32.701 --> 00:03:34.667
[ Applause ]
Oh, my God, he is Cocaine Bear!

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.601
Also, I'd argue nothing
is creepier

00:03:37.601 --> 00:03:40.767
than the way Tucker Carlson
joyously says he's amused.

00:03:40.767 --> 00:03:44.534
-Reporters hate Trump
with an all-consuming mania.

00:03:44.534 --> 00:03:46.634
They hate him so intensely
that, at times,

00:03:46.634 --> 00:03:48.033
it's been amusing to watch.

00:03:48.033 --> 00:03:49.834
-Ugh! That's like Data
from "Star Trek"

00:03:49.834 --> 00:03:51.434
reviewing a Richard Pryor album.

00:03:51.434 --> 00:03:52.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:54.968
Don't get me wrong,
I still prefer Joyless Tucker

00:03:54.968 --> 00:03:56.100
to when he actually laughs.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.801
-[ Laughing ]

00:03:57.801 --> 00:04:01.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.133 --> 00:04:02.601
-Oh, my God, that's a sound
more terrifying

00:04:02.601 --> 00:04:04.667
than hearing a bear snort
a line of cocaine.

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:07.100
[ Laughter ]
That's two Cocaine Bear
references.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.701
I wonder if there's going
to be a third.

00:04:08.701 --> 00:04:10.667
We'll have to wait and see.
It's a long "Closer Look."

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:14.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.601 --> 00:04:15.667
[ Applause ]

00:04:15.667 --> 00:04:17.901
I also love that,
even as recently as 2020,

00:04:17.901 --> 00:04:19.267
Tucker was still pretending
it was some sort

00:04:19.267 --> 00:04:21.234
of grand mystery
why people hated Donald Trump.

00:04:21.234 --> 00:04:23.000
Like even if you forget
all the racism

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.334
and lying and corruption
and bigotry,

00:04:24.334 --> 00:04:26.033
how about the fact that he was
just annoying as [bleep]?

00:04:26.033 --> 00:04:27.067
[ Laughter ]
Like if he was just

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:29.167
a guy you met at a party,
after 20 minutes

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:30.934
of listening
to him scream uninterrupted

00:04:30.934 --> 00:04:32.200
about injecting bleach,

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.367
and windmills killing birds
and toilets not flushing

00:04:34.367 --> 00:04:36.367
and how everyone loves him
because he's the greatest ever,

00:04:36.367 --> 00:04:37.667
you'd pull your spouse aside
and say,

00:04:37.667 --> 00:04:39.200
"Can we please just go home?
This guy won't

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.634
shut the hell up,"
and then they'd say, "We can't.

00:04:40.634 --> 00:04:41.734
He's our Uber driver.

00:04:41.734 --> 00:04:42.634
He just followed us in here."

00:04:42.634 --> 00:04:43.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:43.934 --> 00:04:46.667
Anyway, that's what Tucker
was telling his viewers

00:04:46.667 --> 00:04:49.167
for virtually the entirety
of Donald Trump's presidency --

00:04:49.167 --> 00:04:52.801
The media and the left
hated Donald Trump intensely

00:04:52.801 --> 00:04:54.834
and obsessively.
Those were the words he used.

00:04:54.834 --> 00:04:57.000
Well, now, we know,
thanks to a new cache

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.200
of messages contained in a court
filing from Dominion's

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.767
ongoing defamation lawsuit
against Fox News,

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:04.133
that, in private,
he felt much differently.

00:05:04.133 --> 00:05:07.534
-Thanks to the $1.6 billion
defamation lawsuit filed

00:05:07.534 --> 00:05:09.701
by Dominion Voting Systems
against Fox,

00:05:09.701 --> 00:05:14.234
we now know what Tucker Carlson
really thinks about Donald Trump

00:05:14.234 --> 00:05:16.534
and about Donald Trump's
presidency.

00:05:22.267 --> 00:05:24.334
-...Carlson texted
an unknown person

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:27.133
on January 4, 2021, adding...

00:05:28.667 --> 00:05:30.601
[ Oohs and laughter ]
-Oh, my God!

00:05:30.601 --> 00:05:33.667
It turns out the Trump hatred
was coming from

00:05:33.667 --> 00:05:35.200
[ Echoing ]
inside the house!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.400
[ "Screaming Violins" plays ]

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.000
[ Lightning strikes ]

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.701
[ Screaming laughter ]

00:05:40.701 --> 00:05:42.734
[ Carlson laughing,
spooky background ]

00:05:42.734 --> 00:05:45.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.367
That's right,
Tucker Carlson said

00:05:52.367 --> 00:05:53.868
he couldn't wait to ignore Trump

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:55.334
and that he hated
Trump passionately.

00:05:55.334 --> 00:05:58.501
That's as damning as the time
I got caught texting Trump...

00:06:01.033 --> 00:06:02.534
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.534 --> 00:06:04.334
The only thing I thought Tucker
was capable

00:06:04.334 --> 00:06:05.501
of hating with a passion

00:06:05.501 --> 00:06:08.033
were female M&amp;M's
who are a seven or lower.

00:06:08.033 --> 00:06:10.801
[ Laughter and applause ]
In fact, it turns out,
Tucker said all kinds

00:06:10.801 --> 00:06:12.901
of insulting and denigrating
things about Trump in private,

00:06:12.901 --> 00:06:14.234
while claiming it was
everyone else

00:06:14.234 --> 00:06:16.534
who had succumbed to intense
Trump hatred in public.

00:06:16.534 --> 00:06:18.033
At one point, according
to the Dominion filings,

00:06:18.033 --> 00:06:18.767
he called Trump...

00:06:20.467 --> 00:06:22.701
In another message, he said,
of Trump's businesses...

00:06:27.267 --> 00:06:29.067
[ Laughter ]
In more newly released messages,

00:06:29.067 --> 00:06:31.100
he called the Trump legal team's
election lies...

00:06:32.534 --> 00:06:33.200
...and said...

00:06:34.501 --> 00:06:35.968
He called Trump's decision not

00:06:35.968 --> 00:06:37.367
to attend Joe Biden's
inauguration...

00:06:38.501 --> 00:06:39.701
...and said,
of Trump's behavior...

00:06:41.834 --> 00:06:44.067
[ Laughter ]
You know, I never
would've imagined

00:06:44.067 --> 00:06:45.701
that Tucker
might watch this show,

00:06:45.701 --> 00:06:47.234
until I saw those text messages.

00:06:47.234 --> 00:06:49.667
[ Laughter ]
I mean, seems like our message

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:51.100
might really resonate
with that guy.

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.400
[ Laughter ]
I mean, if you're watching,
hey, Tuck.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:55.467 --> 00:06:57.767
In fact, Tucker's contempt
for Trump was so profound,

00:06:57.767 --> 00:06:59.734
and his mockery of the Trump
team was so biting that,

00:06:59.734 --> 00:07:02.801
according to a new court filing,
he was even texting pictures

00:07:02.801 --> 00:07:04.634
of Rudy Giuliani's
leaking hair dye

00:07:04.634 --> 00:07:07.300
[ Laughter ]
from the infamous press
conference with the message...

00:07:08.501 --> 00:07:12.033
[ Laughter ]
Interesting fact --
when Rudy's mind is blown,

00:07:12.033 --> 00:07:13.667
you can tell
because his head starts

00:07:13.667 --> 00:07:15.100
to leak. That's --
[ Laughter ]

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.968
[ As Giuliani ]
Uh-oh! Anyone got
a monkey wrench?

00:07:16.968 --> 00:07:18.701
I need to tighten
my brain gasket.

00:07:18.701 --> 00:07:21.601
[ Laughter ]
And it's worth keeping all
of this in mind

00:07:21.601 --> 00:07:23.701
when you're watching
what they say and do now

00:07:23.701 --> 00:07:25.300
because, sure, you might be
thinking to yourself,

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.901
"Fox is just one TV channel,"

00:07:26.901 --> 00:07:29.334
but one of our two major parties
is captive to it.

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:31.133
In fact,
the GOP speaker of the House,

00:07:31.133 --> 00:07:32.734
Kevin McChicken, I think --
I can't remember --

00:07:32.734 --> 00:07:34.167
[ Laughter ]
just gave Tucker

00:07:34.167 --> 00:07:36.601
exclusive access
to thousands of hours

00:07:36.601 --> 00:07:38.400
of security footage
from January 6th.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.234
In fact, Tucker's still doing
his shtick.

00:07:40.234 --> 00:07:42.434
Despite all the revelations
on Monday,

00:07:42.434 --> 00:07:44.634
he had this to say
about the 2020 election,

00:07:44.634 --> 00:07:46.834
while introducing
his supposed exposé

00:07:46.834 --> 00:07:48.534
on the insurrection
on January 6th.

00:07:48.534 --> 00:07:50.400
-On January 6th, two years ago,

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.400
thousands of protesters walked
from a Trump rally

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.968
on the Ellipse,
outside the White House,

00:07:54.968 --> 00:07:56.934
to the U.S. Capitol,
where the certification

00:07:56.934 --> 00:07:59.400
of the presidential election
was underway.

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.167
The protesters were angry.

00:08:01.167 --> 00:08:03.701
They believed that the election
they had just voted in

00:08:03.701 --> 00:08:07.200
had been unfairly conducted,
and they were right.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.634
In retrospect,
it is clear the 2020 election

00:08:09.634 --> 00:08:13.067
was a grave betrayal
of American democracy.

00:08:13.067 --> 00:08:15.467
Given the facts that have since
emerged about that election,

00:08:15.467 --> 00:08:17.434
no honest person can deny it.

00:08:17.434 --> 00:08:19.868
-You're like a guy selling
fake bags in Times Square,

00:08:19.868 --> 00:08:21.100
who's not even trying anymore.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.701
"Um, excuse me, this Hermès bag

00:08:22.701 --> 00:08:24.767
is spelled with a "P,"
like Herpes.

00:08:24.767 --> 00:08:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:27.567 --> 00:08:29.501
[ New York accent ]
It's pronounced Herpès.

00:08:29.501 --> 00:08:30.868
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.868 --> 00:08:33.067
Also, I love the choice of words
when he says,

00:08:33.067 --> 00:08:34.834
"No honest person can deny"
that.

00:08:34.834 --> 00:08:36.300
So, since it's now been proven

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.934
that you're not
an honest person,

00:08:37.934 --> 00:08:39.467
does that mean
you can deny that?

00:08:39.467 --> 00:08:42.267
And, if you deny that, then does
that mean denying it is a lie?

00:08:42.267 --> 00:08:45.133
And if denying it is a lie,
does that mean you would deny it

00:08:45.133 --> 00:08:46.834
because you're a proven liar,
which would then mean

00:08:46.834 --> 00:08:48.133
that denying it is
actually the truth?

00:08:48.133 --> 00:08:50.033
Deciphering this bull[bleep]
is like staring

00:08:50.033 --> 00:08:52.234
at an M.C. Escher painting,
which, incidentally,

00:08:52.234 --> 00:08:54.434
is what Tucker Carlson
always looks like he's doing.

00:08:54.434 --> 00:08:56.133
[ Laughter ]

00:08:56.133 --> 00:08:58.234
Tucker's cherry-picked footage
from January 6th

00:08:58.234 --> 00:09:00.067
was such transparent nonsense

00:09:00.067 --> 00:09:01.968
that even Republican leadership
called it out.

00:09:01.968 --> 00:09:03.400
Various GOP senators called it

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.467
"dangerous and disgusting"
and "a lie,"

00:09:05.467 --> 00:09:07.000
and one even went so far

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.868
as to call Tucker's report
"bull[bleep]."

00:09:08.868 --> 00:09:11.434
And I have to say, even if you
didn't know any of that,

00:09:11.434 --> 00:09:13.968
just watching what he aired is
embarrassing enough on its own.

00:09:13.968 --> 00:09:16.634
Like, for example, Tucker tried
to claim the infamous footage

00:09:16.634 --> 00:09:19.501
of Missouri Senator Josh Hawley
running away from the mob

00:09:19.501 --> 00:09:22.400
[ Laughter ]
was, somehow, misleadingly
edited by Democrats,

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:25.167
but Tucker's proof for that
was very underwhelming.

00:09:25.167 --> 00:09:27.734
-To prove that Josh Hawley
was a coward,

00:09:27.734 --> 00:09:29.767
the committee released video
of him loping

00:09:29.767 --> 00:09:32.200
out of the building
on the afternoon of January 6th,

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.834
with a police escort.

00:09:33.834 --> 00:09:36.467
The tape became a staple
on social media.

00:09:36.467 --> 00:09:38.300
Democrats laughed with derision.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:41.234
But, in fact, the surveillance
footage we reviewed shows

00:09:41.234 --> 00:09:43.267
that famous clip was a sham,

00:09:43.267 --> 00:09:46.334
edited deceptively
by the January 6th Committee.

00:09:46.334 --> 00:09:48.767
The clip was propaganda,
not evidence.

00:09:48.767 --> 00:09:51.200
The actual videotape shows
that Hawley was one

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.901
of many lawmakers being ushered
out of the building

00:09:53.901 --> 00:09:56.000
by Capitol Hill police officers.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:59.133
And, in fact, Hawley was
at the back of the pack.

00:09:59.133 --> 00:10:01.167
The coward tape was a lie,

00:10:01.167 --> 00:10:03.400
one of many from the
January 6th Committee.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:04.601
-Wait, that's your proof,

00:10:04.601 --> 00:10:06.968
that he was slower
than everyone else?

00:10:06.968 --> 00:10:09.033
[ Laughter ]

00:10:09.033 --> 00:10:12.234
You're just adding a second
insult on top of the first one.

00:10:12.234 --> 00:10:14.334
[ Laughter ]
Of course he wasn't
the only one running.

00:10:14.334 --> 00:10:15.734
It was a violent attack
on the Capitol.

00:10:15.734 --> 00:10:18.300
The point is not just
that he was a coward,

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.734
it's that he was a hypocrite.

00:10:19.734 --> 00:10:22.334
He raised his fist to the mob,
then he ran away from them.

00:10:22.334 --> 00:10:25.067
Basically, he's the one
who gave the bear

00:10:25.067 --> 00:10:26.734
all the cocaine,
in the first place.

00:10:26.734 --> 00:10:28.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.567
"Hey, bear,
I'll share my party favors,

00:10:30.567 --> 00:10:32.834
but you better not go berserk
in the woods.

00:10:32.834 --> 00:10:34.300
Whoa, bear!"

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:37.267
What was really a sham was

00:10:37.267 --> 00:10:39.734
the entire Trump presidency
and the propaganda pumped out

00:10:39.734 --> 00:10:41.067
by Fox hosts,
like Tucker Carlson,

00:10:41.067 --> 00:10:42.634
as evidenced
by these new court filings.

00:10:42.634 --> 00:10:44.367
This whole scandal
has been shocking,

00:10:44.367 --> 00:10:46.267
you know, nauseating,
but also, much like

00:10:46.267 --> 00:10:48.100
a coked-up bear rampaging
through the woods...

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.601
-It's been amusing to watch.

00:10:49.601 --> 00:10:51.667
[ Laughter ]
-This has been a closer look.

00:10:51.667 --> 00:10:55.300
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

